  "goodToKnow": "Die Momentaufnahme is a snapshot, a photo taken in an instant, and figuratively a picture of the current state that may soon change. Politicians who are trailing like to say a poll is nur eine Momentaufnahme. For a casual photo, der Schnappschuss is common. Die Aufnahme means photo, recording or admission. Plural: die Momentaufnahmen."
